    },
    {
        "text": "Early the next morning, the restaurant is still quiet, save for a few fowlbeasts jumping back and forth on the fallen leaves outside the door."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_wing"
    },
    {
        "text": "The night watchman at the Judicial Review Office lets out a loud yawn. The fowlbeasts take off in all directions."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$normal_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "*Yawns* Ughh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#19$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had a nightmare last night that a beckbeast ate all the flour in my kitchen. How terrifying!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "200,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "text": "Morning!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 10,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_plateplace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have some noodles!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... figured out how to make them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at the bags under your eyes. Were you practicing all night?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha. No. Only about half the night. Hey, Xingzhu still hasn't woken up yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough talking for now. Try the noodles!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You.... huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#15$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You gave up learning how to knead the dough and boiled some ready-made noodles instead?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "These are no ordinary ready-made noodles. Xingzhu and I looked through all the ready-made noodles on the market, and picked the ones we feel have a texture closest to your hand-made ones.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, they don't have quite the same mouthfeel as hand-made noodles. So Xingzhu adjusted your soup base recipe to ensure they taste similar to the longevity noodles you make from scratch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#15$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is blasphemy! You're using ready-made noodles, and you tampered with my recipe? My word!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't jump to any conclusions yet. Please, have a taste!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#15$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Young Chef picks up his chopsticks, and, with a giant frown on his face, pulls out some of the noodles. He carefully takes a sniff, then finally takes a taste."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_eatnoodle_single",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#15$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Say something!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did you two think this would work?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Xingzhu was starving after all my failed attempts! I figured at that point, I was better off just making noodles I knew how to make, so at least she'd have something to eat!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I started thinking: the most important element of longevity noodles isn't the taste. Instead, it's making sure the person who eats them feels the birthday blessing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Some people just aren't skilled enough to make noodles like you do. However, I can still use ready-made noodles to bring birthday blessings to myself or my family. That's the real meaning of longevity noodles, anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "See how yellow and shiny these noodles are? They look more lively than yours, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, yes, I am taking shortcuts with this dish...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mentioned birthday blessings. Do you think people can taste that in your noodles?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... think so?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Last night, after I finally made a proper bowl of noodles for the first time, I shared them with Xingzhu. We felt so happy when eating it. I even caught Xingzhu wiping away tears...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Swapping out the noodles, then adjusting the oil and salt ratios accordingly... Quite some innovation there. Xingzhu sure has a sharp palate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the ready-made noodles need to be rinsed with cold water after cooking. You rinsed them, but you didn't drain all the cold water out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cold water lowered the temperature of the soup, which also affected the texture of the noodles. If you really want to make good food, you need to be mindful of these little details.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it! I'll remember that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, then you mean...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough. I'm only continuing to teach you because I can see you've put in the effort.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You still need to learn how to make your own noodles from scratch. You don't really expect to use ready-made noodles in the competition, do you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe. Great!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "As your shifu, I'm glad that you've improved. But we still have to see whether the customers recognize your efforts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well... what do we do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Later on, if anyone orders noodles, you'll make them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the customer doesn't like the noodles, then you'll need to keep practicing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm on it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
