    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_walkfast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello! Would you like to try our special longevity noodles?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not my birthday. Why would I want longevity noodles?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp Dressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a new dish we're trying out. We'll give it to you for free!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. I meant, if you try it, and like it, then maybe you should still pay for it. I mean, I have to settle up with the boss, you know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's... an interesting way to do business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp Dressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure. Give me that bowl of noodles, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp Dressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(eager eyes)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uhh... do you need something else from me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp Dressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No! No! I just want to see how you like the noodles.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay okay. I'll give them a try.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp Dressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_dishes"
    },
    {
        "text": "The man picks up one single noodle using his chopsticks, then a piece of bok choy, and some scallions. He tries them one after another."
    },
    {
        "text": "He eats with graceful manners, but somehow, in just a few moments' time, the entire bowl is empty."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you think?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmmm... Good. Even excellent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp Dressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "R-Really?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The soup has a rich umami taste, and the ingredients are top notch. If you had let the soup simmer for another day or so, it might have tasted even better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp Dressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I was already so hungry. If I had tried to wait another day for that ultimate perfection, I would have starved...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp Dressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "He wants to create the perfect taste, but the customer cannot wait that long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp Dressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if I want to wait for him... there are some things that I just can't wait for any longer...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp Dressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're saying...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about it. Just tell your boss what I said, yeah?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp Dressed Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "The man stands up. The patterns on his clothes emit a strange glow; the light distorts and blurs his face, so much so that Blaze cannot make out what he looks like."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! You... you didn't pay!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Just deduct the funds from my account.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sharp Dressed Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
