    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1644_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Regardless of what you're looking for, after you leave here, do not tell anyone you got this file from the Academy. Do you understand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1644_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong? Do you have more questions?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1644_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you remember... that bloody case... back in 1062?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't the sort of thing you casually bring up in a conversation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1644_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just happened to think of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is the Grand Preceptor you previously mentioned, the one who supported the academic reforms which benefited countless poor students, the same Grand Preceptor who murdered the emperor and plotted treason forty years ago?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no way to answer your question. I will never speak about things that I do not know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have never met that Grand Preceptor in person, but I have read some of her writings on political and social issues. Her extensive knowledge, clearly reflected in her works, has been deeply enriching for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "text": "But people are complicated and cannot be easily categorized.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1644_1#13$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're saying you're not completely convinced that the outcome of that case was correct?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Qingyan, you are never good at hiding what you are thinking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew you would...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1644_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Office's archives will not house muddled cases, no matter how many people they involve.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Solving those cases is my duty as deputy minister.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I shall not dissuade you from doing as you see fit. However, you must learn to protect yourself, no matter what happens.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* Before your parents retreated into seclusion in the mountains, they entrusted me with looking after you. If anything were to happen to you, I would never be able to look them in the eyes again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1644_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not a child. Why do I need people to take care of me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone feels that way when they are young. However, as a mother, watching Zuo Le grow up, day by day, I feel a weight growing on my heart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "text": "What else should we parents worry about, other than our children's safety?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if your parents learned that I prevented you from fulfilling your duties out of concern for your 'safety', then they really would blame me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1644_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Duoxie... Sister...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* You call me your sister, but in my eyes, you have always been like a child of my son's generation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1644_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Speaking of which, Yumen is near Baizao now. Have you seen General Zuo at all over the past few days?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Things are coming to a head. The Ministry of War is holding meetings day and night, and the general must remain on the front lines to oversee things personally.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "text": "Neither he nor I can abandon our posts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1644_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is truly no way to avoid this conflict?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't something I have the authority to decide.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "text": "As an Advisor for the Ministry of War, my job is to do everything in my power to accurately calculate the outcome of the war. Allowing any personal biases to affect my work would be a grave disservice to the people of Yan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't compromise in your duties, and neither do I.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1644_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope everything goes smoothly...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the outcome is inevitable, it's best not to worry too much about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you are alone for the Mid-Autumn Festival, come to my home for dinner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1644_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait... I just thought of something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you just ask me who has authority to alter the Academy's records?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That did happen once, although it was under extremely unusual circumstances.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1644_1#13$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. I can't say that the records were ever altered. However, if a record has gone missing entirely, then it must have been transferred to another location\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1620_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Death row, at the Ministry of Justice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Professor Jing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
