    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "Father is not here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been more than six months since he was last here. The furnishings in the house have not changed, only there are many more symbols symbolizing war on the sand table."
    },
    {
        "text": "A lone city stands in defiance, the two sides gazing at each other from afar."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lord Zuo...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "A thick, familiar voice rings out from behind."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uncle Taihe!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your... your injuries?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was finally able to walk since two weeks ago, albeit with some difficulty. At least I'm no longer bedridden.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Zuo Le stares at Taihe unbelievably, who does not look like the man he remembers."
    },
    {
        "text": "The wind lifts a corner of his cloak, revealing his thin, withered figure under his wide robe."
    },
    {
        "text": "Taihe, once a man so strong and sturdy, is now emaciated. It's as if a mere gust of wind could blow him away."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uncle Taihe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kung fu is merely an external tool. I am, after all, still a monitor censor of the Department of Discipline and Supervision, and there will always be opportunities to realize my aspirations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you continue to dwell on this, Lord Zuo, then you're only underestimating my skills.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Taihe, I know you are no ordinary man. A few injuries aren't enough to stop you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "text": "It has been over six months since we last met. You look stronger than before. The General will be pleased.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way, Father is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The General has been in constant meetings with the Sui Regulator and the Ministry of War. He's barely had ten minutes to rest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The situation...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Could change in an instant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is the court still ready to go to war at all costs?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, after the incident in Dahuang, the bestial Sui is no longer under the Sui Regulator's control.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are some minor disagreements between the cabinet and the Six Ministries, but their overall opinion is clear\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eliminate the threat once and for all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... the consequences of this war will be...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
