        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "35_g7_zuosroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard that one month ago, other Candleholders discovered traces of the convict near Baizao.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. I heard the same thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "text": "The imperial court is on high alert; they've already dispatched several units of Imperial Guards.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Imperial Guards...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The convict's unpredictability is currently the gravest threat we face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a theory, perhaps...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is still another Proxy in Baizao...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "This Proxy is the 'youngest', and the most unique.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "According to the Sui Regulator's observations, in the hundreds of years since he left the tomb, he has never used any of his powers. The Sui Regulator does not know how to deal with him...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's only one thing that's a little suspicious\u2014one hundred years ago, after Wang escaped from prison, he came to Baizao and has remained here ever since.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wang used to frequently interact with other Proxies, so I am afraid that during his current return to Baizao, the lone Proxy who stayed here would also be part of his plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you plan to do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know yet, so I'm going to go take a look...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...And see for myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
