        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew! Finished!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you think? I've memorized every step, from washing the vegetables to serving the noodles. I can do this all by myself now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, it's all thanks to Xingzhu for figuring out a genius solution\u2014I just need to dip my hands in ice water for five minutes before kneading the dough, and it comes out fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4172_xingzh_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It looks good, and I can taste the craftsmanship in the dish.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Xingzhu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'll do, even if it's far from perfect.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "text": "If anyone could cook as well as me after just a few classes, then all my years of study would be in vain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, I've been working hard for so long, and tomorrow is the big day. Can't you at least say something encouraging?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#15$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just don't want you to get a big head... Alright, maybe you're right\u2014a little pep talk might do you good; otherwise, you'd be too scared to cook the minute you meet Mo Bufu.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2026_yu_1#21$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember: there's nothing to be afraid of. Mo Bufu is old. Show him the power of your youth!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything's ready. Let's go win one at Ding Feng Lou tomorrow!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
